@startuml SEQ_06_MENGELOLA_PERMOHONAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-06: Mengelola Permohonan Pengadaan

actor       "Admin"                 as Admin
boundary    "Browser"               as Browser
control     "InventarisController"  as Controller
entity      "PermohonanAset Model"  as ModelPA

== Lihat Permohonan ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Buka menu permohonan
Browser --> Admin : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/permohonan
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPA  : Query permohonan
ModelPA --> Controller : Data permohonan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman
Browser --> Admin      : Tampil daftar permohonan

== Lihat Detail ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Klik "Detail"
Browser --> Admin : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/permohonan/{id}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPA  : Query detail
ModelPA --> Controller : Detail permohonan
Controller --> Browser : Render detail
Browser --> Admin      : Tampil detail permohonan

== Hapus Permohonan ==

Admin   -> Browser     : Klik "Hapus"
Browser --> Admin : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : DELETE /inventaris/permohonan/{id}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPA  : delete()
ModelPA --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect + notifikasi
Browser --> Admin      : Permohonan terhapus

@enduml